## Implementation Progress Tracking

Use this parameter with implementation progress tracking to manage log-based implementations:

```typescript
// Update implementation progress
edit_file("planning/feature-name/implementation-progress.md",
          "Update implementation progress with log analysis findings",
          "// ... existing content ...\n\n" +
          "## Log Analysis Summary\n\n" +
          "- Issues Identified: [count]\n" +
          "- Components Affected: [list]\n" +
          "- Critical Errors: [count]\n" +
          "- Fixed Issues: [count]\n\n" +
          "## Implementation Status\n\n" +
          "- [component]: Fixed [issue description]\n" +
          "- [component]: Added logging for [scenario]\n" +
          "- [component]: Enhanced error handling\n\n" +
          "// ... existing content ...")
```

## Completion Criteria

The log-based implementation is complete when:

1. **Error Resolution**: All identified errors in logs are resolved
2. **Log Verification**: New logs show correct behavior
3. **Test Coverage**: Tests for identified scenarios are created and passing
4. **Enhanced Logging**: Appropriate logging is added for future diagnosis
5. **Documentation**: Issues and their resolutions are documented 